        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the table, locate the privileged portal you want to modify and click the Edit icon.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          76,
          80
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Edit Portal window appears.",
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          15
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Edit Portal window, modify fields as necessary. To learn more about each field, see Configuring Privileged Portals.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          18
        ]
      ]
